5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to verify the actual costs from last year before we commit to anything new.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to understand the operational burden. Last year’s organizers were exhausted.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I need to know if the year-groups actually mix or stay in their own bubbles.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I need to understand the sleeping conditions. Last year, half the group was exhausted from poor rest.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to verify how the flat fee distributes. I suspect the side costs and dropout penalties are unfairly burdening specific members.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
