35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Transport is 38% of costs if we go far. Public beds are 1,100 yen a night, all-inclusive. I need to see how these numbers compare to last year's actuals.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The cooking duty alone consumed two hours daily. That is a month of evenings lost. We need a venue with staff to handle meals.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,"A fifth never showed up, and a third can't make the nine o'clock train without paying for a bed. We need a location that actually pulls people in.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The public beds are 1,100 yen a night, all-inclusive. However, the lottery is six months out, and any date change requires a full resubmission. That rigidity worries me.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The whole-building deposit is non-refundable. If someone drops out, the rest of us absorb that cost. I need to see how that risk is distributed.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, that non-refundable deposit is a structural risk. I need to know if the transport savings offset that liability before I agree to any fee.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, the transport savings are irrelevant if the organizers burn out. I need a venue that removes the daily duty burden entirely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, I agree. But if we stay local, the year-groups just retreat to their own dorms. We need a setting that forces interaction, not just convenience.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I understand the social need, but I cannot risk another week of poor sleep. I need a place where the nights are genuinely quiet and restful.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, sleep is vital, but the financial exposure is immediate. If the deposit is non-refundable, we need a strict headcount to prevent individual members from absorbing the loss.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, I hear you on the burnout, but I cannot ignore the financial gap. We need a venue that minimizes both the labor and the liability.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, I agree. We need a venue that removes the daily duty burden entirely.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Ryuji, I agree. But a venue that minimizes labor might just isolate us further. We need a place where the year-groups are forced to share space, not just coexist.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I agree that shared space helps, but only if the noise levels allow for actual rest. I need to know if the public beds offer any privacy or quiet zones.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, privacy is secondary to financial security. If the deposit is non-refundable, we must lock the headcount early to prevent individual members from absorbing the loss.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, I agree. We must lock the headcount early. I will not announce a fee until I know the exact liability per person.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, agreed. But the real cost is the organizers' time. We need a venue that eliminates the daily duty burden entirely.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, I agree. But eliminating duty is not enough. We need a setting that breaks the year-group silos. I will vote for the option that forces interaction.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I agree that interaction is valuable, but only if it does not compromise rest. I will support the option that balances social mixing with genuine quiet for sleep.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, I agree on the social need, but I will only support an option with a strict headcount. I refuse to let one person's dropout bankrupt the rest.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
