72,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, I agree. Removing the duty burden is essential. But Option A is the only setting that forces the year-groups to share evenings, breaking the silos we need to dismantle.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Toshio, I agree that removing the duty burden is vital. However, I need assurance that the coastal lodge provides genuine quiet for sleep, unlike the noisy dorms of last year.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, I cannot guarantee the noise levels, but I can guarantee the financial structure. If we choose A, we must lock the headcount immediately to protect the deposit.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
